        "HOSXKQPT-1": "stay_1042"
      },
      "unit": {
        "HOSX-PAR-QZRJVT": "unit_204"
      }
    }
  },
  "identity": "Each event id is derived from the Apaleo entity id, the HOS type and Apaleo's own time for the change, so a redelivered webhook yields the same id. HOS ids come from the integration's crosswalk and are never the Apaleo ids. Access tokens are omitted from the recorded requests.",
